B442WP — Base44 to WordPress Converter
Change History
======================================

Version 1.1.0 — 2026-02-27
  - Full PHP web application (b442wp-app/) added:
    - Pay-per-conversion service ($9 basic / $19 WooCommerce)
    - User authentication (register, login, password reset)
    - Base44 zip upload + free analysis/preview
    - Stripe and PayPal one-time payment integration
    - Claude API (Sonnet) conversion engine
    - WordPress theme assembler + zip packaging
    - 30-day download expiry with cleanup cron
    - Dashboard with conversion history
    - Account management

  Files added:
    b442wp-app/ — complete PHP application
    b442wp-app/converter/ — Parser, Analyzer, ClaudeClient, Converter, Assembler
    b442wp-app/converter/prompts/ — AI prompt templates with 11 converter rules
    b442wp-app/wp-skeleton/ — WordPress template stubs
    b442wp-app/includes/ — db, auth, helpers, middleware, stripe, paypal
    b442wp-app/pages/ — all page handlers
    b442wp-app/templates/ — HTML shell layout
    b442wp-app/assets/ — CSS + JS

Version 1.0.0 — 2026-02-26
  - Initial release: Screwed TOS Scan WordPress theme (reference conversion)
    - screwed-theme/ — complete WordPress theme
    - screwed-theme.zip — upload-ready theme package
    - scanner/ — auto style extractor (no DevTools required)
      - scan-styles.js — fetches live URL, parses CSS + Tailwind classes
      - generate-css-vars.js — outputs CSS custom properties from scan JSON
